          "adaptation": "Reaction predictor probabilities and calibrated uncertainty estimates are treated as uncertain continuous perception, while mechanistic incompatibility variables, protecting-group states, chemoselectivity constraints, and route rules form the discrete symbolic planning layer. The planner propagates predictor uncertainty into route-level symbolic feasibility constraints.",
